---
import Base from "~/layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "~/config/site";

const lastUpdated = "23 April 2026";
---

<Base
  title="Terms"
  description={`${site.legalName} website terms of use.`}
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container-page max-w-3xl">
      <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5">Website terms</h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-moss text-[0.9rem]">Last updated: {lastUpdated}</p>

      <div class="maz-prose mt-10">
        <p>
          These terms govern your use of <a href={site.url}>{site.url}</a>. By
          accessing or using this website, you agree to these terms. If you do
          not agree, please do not use the site.
        </p>

        <h2>Who operates this site</h2>
        <p>
          This website is operated by {site.legalName}, trading as {site.brand},
          company number {site.legal.companyNumber}, with registered office at
          {site.legal.registeredAddress}. The site is aimed primarily at
          business users looking for Amazon advertising support, audits, case
          studies and related information.
        </p>

        <h2>Permitted use</h2>
        <p>
          You may browse the site and use it for legitimate informational and
          business enquiry purposes only. You must not misuse the site, attempt
          to gain unauthorised access to any systems, interfere with security
          or availability, scrape the site unlawfully, or use the content in a
          way that infringes our rights or the rights of others.
        </p>

        <h2>Informational only</h2>
        <p>
          The website is provided for general information and marketing
          purposes. Nothing on the site constitutes legal, financial, tax,
          investment or professional advice, and nothing on the site is a
          binding offer to provide services.
        </p>

        <h2>No reliance and results disclaimer</h2>
        <p>
          We aim to keep content accurate and up to date, but we do not promise
          that all information on the site is complete, current or free from
          error. Case studies, testimonials, examples and performance figures
          are included to illustrate past work only. They are not guarantees of
          future performance, and outcomes will vary by category, product,
          market conditions, budget, operations and many other factors outside
          our control.
        </p>

        <h2>Bookings, audits and external tools</h2>
        <p>
          The site may link to or embed third-party tools and services,
          including booking tools, analytics tools, advertising technologies
          and other external services we use from time to time. Those third
          parties operate under their own terms and privacy notices, and we are
          not responsible for their content, availability or policies.
        </p>

        <h2>Service engagements</h2>
        <p>
          Any Amazon advertising services, audits, consulting, onboarding,
          account access or deliverables that we provide are governed by a
          separate signed proposal, statement of work, master services
          agreement or other engagement contract between us and the relevant
          client. These website terms do not replace or amend any such
          agreement.
        </p>

        <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
        <p>
          Unless otherwise stated, all text, layout, branding, graphics,
          documents and other content on this website are owned by or licensed
          to {site.legalName} and are protected by intellectual property laws.
          You may view the site for your own internal business use, but you
          must not copy, republish, adapt, distribute or commercially exploit
          site content without permission.
        </p>
        <p>
          Client names, logos, trade marks and product marks remain the
          property of their respective owners and are used for identification
          and portfolio purposes only.
        </p>

        <h2>User submissions</h2>
        <p>
          If you send us information through a contact form, email, booking
          form or similar enquiry flow, you confirm that the information is
          accurate to the best of your knowledge and that you have the right to
          share it.
          Do not submit confidential or sensitive information unless and until
          an appropriate business relationship and any necessary confidentiality
          protections are in place.
        </p>

        <h2>Availability and security</h2>
        <p>
          We may change, suspend or withdraw any part of the website at any
          time without notice. We do not guarantee that the site will always be
          available, uninterrupted, secure or free from bugs or harmful code,
          although we take reasonable steps to maintain it.
        </p>

        <h2>Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by law, {site.legalName} excludes all
          implied warranties, representations and conditions in relation to the
          website and its content. We are not liable for any indirect,
          incidental, consequential, special or business losses arising from or
          connected with your use of, or inability to use, the website.
        </p>
        <p>
          Nothing in these terms excludes or limits liability that cannot
          legally be excluded, including liability for fraud, fraudulent
          misrepresentation, or death or personal injury caused by negligence.
        </p>

        <h2>Privacy and cookies</h2>
        <p>
          Your use of the site is also subject to our
          <a href="/privacy"> privacy policy</a> and
          <a href="/cookies"> cookie and tracking notice</a>.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing law</h2>
        <p>
          These terms and any dispute or claim arising from them or the use of
          the website are governed by the laws of England and Wales, and the
          courts of England and Wales will have exclusive jurisdiction, unless
          applicable mandatory law in your jurisdiction provides otherwise.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact</h2>
        <p>
          Questions about these terms can be sent to
          <a href={`mailto:${site.contact.email}`}>{site.contact.email}</a>.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .maz-prose h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    margin-top: 2rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }
  .maz-prose p { margin: 0.75rem 0; color: var(--color-ink); line-height: 1.7; }
  .maz-prose a {
    color: var(--color-ink);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--color-gold);
    text-underline-offset: 3px;
  }
</style>
